\
## 6. Companion & Interaction Entities\
Objekte f\'fcr Buddy, Check-ins und Guidance\
\
## 7. Human & Collaboration Entities\
Objekte f\'fcr Coach, Review und menschliche Intervention\
\
## 8. Commerce, Content & Expansion Entities\
